[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
ServiceTypes=Krita/PythonPlugin
X-KDE-Library=ps_tools
X-Python-2-Compatible=false
X-Krita-Manual=Manual.html
Name=Blend If and Masks (Photoshop-style)
Comment=Blend If in the layer right-click menu, Photoshop-style clipping masks (Alt+click between layers), pasting images into masks, an Add Mask button in the Layers docker.
